bob","skin":null},"stage":null}],"costumes":[],"weapons":[],"profile":{"Age":[26],"Height":[170],"Weight":[65]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"波比，坎特伯雷王国骑士团“守护者”团员。\n\n胆怯，对坎特伯雷王国的忠诚却胜过所有人。以为变强，就能改变胆小的性格，勤奋训练，换来的只有强大实力，依旧胆小怕事。被突袭吓到，过一段时间才能平缓，完全镇定下来之后，便能英勇参战。见到波比受惊的团员们毫不避讳地取笑他，齐喊“波比馒头”。","storyKey":"profile_guardian_bob_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=179","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=179","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"guardian_bob","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["好像每次都在跟你表达感谢。"],"enUS":["I feel like I'm always thanking you."],"jaJP":["君にはいつもありがとうと言ってる気がするね"]},"keys":["Voice_guardian_bob_1_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["很快就会见到大家的。"],"enUS":["We'll be able to meet everyone again soon."],"jaJP":["もうすぐみんなとまた会えるよ"]},"keys":["Voice_guardian_bob_1_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["琳达要是再冷静一点就好了…"],"enUS":["It'd be nice if Linda was a little calmer...."],"jaJP":["リンダも、もう少し落ち着いてくれたらいいんだけど"]},"keys":["Voice_guardian_bob_1_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["大家…都还好吧？"],"enUS":["Will everyone... be okay?"],"jaJP":["みんな…大丈夫かな？"]},"keys":["Voice_guardian_bob_1_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["这里有新邮件，要打开吗？"],"enUS":["Here's some new mail. Would you open it?"],"jaJP":["新しいメールが来たよ、開けてみる？"]},"keys":["Voice_guardian_bob_1_NoticeMail"]}]}]}
